cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use kannada-spell, please cite it as below."
title: "kannada-spell: a Kannada Hunspell dictionary, morphological analyzer and stemmer"
abstract: "A Kannada spelling dictionary for Hunspell, LibreOffice and Firefox, generated from 1 description of Kannada inflection as paradigms with sandhi rules, together with a morphological analyzer and stemmer that accept exactly the same words, and sound-alike keys for fuzzy search. The packaged dictionary accepts 88.9% of held-out tokens from Kannada Wikipedia."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Subrahmanya
    given-names: Prasad
    website: "https://prasad.tech"
repository-code: "https://github.com/openkannada/kannada-spell"
url: "https://openkannada.org/spell-check/"
license:
